  "configuration_id": "config_010",
  "reason": "With only one completed experiment (config_001: rna_only, singleprofile, pca_n2000 → 48.5% acc), the most critical uncertainty is whether the image modality carries useful signal for this task at all. config_010 (image_only, singleprofile, resnet50) is the cleanest test of this question: it matches config_001 on profile setting (singleprofile) and model simplicity, changing only the modality. This isolates the 'does image information help?' question without confounding with fusion strategy, aggregation, or multiprofile complexity. The result will directly inform whether to invest subsequent experiments in multimodal fusion (if image is strong) or in RNA encoder/profile improvements (if image is weak), making it the highest-information-value use of the next budget slot."
}

